## Purpose

Review the proposed typed scientific-control architecture, service boundaries, state factorization, mandatory invariants and post-freeze build sequence without treating the skeleton as admitted V2 design.

## Current components

- immutable identities and receipts;
- ProblemContract and frontier opportunity entry;
- plural ScientificState/ObligationState/HypothesisPortfolio;
