The programme is allowed to invent new machinery, but **only after a collision/insufficiency witness** under #48/#50 rules.

Candidate unsolved mechanics requiring research rather than naming:

## M1 — typed hybrid cognitive state

Need a representation that can jointly support:
- dense semantic/continuous information;
- discrete objects/relations/goals;
- uncertainty;
