Need a policy that allocates recurrent depth, retrieval, tools and verification according to problem state, not a fixed chain length.

## M6 — verified learning update

Need to specify how a verified/falsified episode changes persistent memory or learned parameters while preserving:
- provenance;
- applicability scope;
- rollback;
