# 9. Matched-comparator design

Every claimed advantage must survive the strongest applicable comparator.

At minimum maintain:

- `B0`: exact conventional algorithm / automaton / data-structure parent;
- `B1`: specified finite-depth Transformer;
- `B2`: Transformer decoder with allowed intermediate steps;
- `B3`: Universal/recurrent/looped Transformer;
- `B4`: strongest relevant SSM/recurrent architecture;
- `B5`: external-memory/retrieval parent;
- `B6`: neural/differentiable memory parent;
- `B7`: strongest parent composition with the same memory/tools/verifier;
- `B8`: OCM without ORION verification/authority mechanics;
- `B9`: full OCM candidate;
- `BQ`: OCM + quantum operator only on eligible theorem-defined tasks.

Compare at matched declared coordinates, not parameter count alone.

A parent can win. In fact, early studies should be designed so parent wins are common enough to detect a biased harness.

---

# 10. Kill / contraction criteria

The programme must be able to discover that the grand architecture is wrong or scientifically redundant.

- `K0 PARENT_EQUIVALENT`: strongest recurrent/Universal Transformer or parent product simulates OCM with no meaningful resource residual.
- `K1 HIDDEN_MEMORY_WIN`: apparent parameter advantage disappears after full memory/index/bandwidth accounting.
- `K2 HIDDEN_RUNTIME_WIN`: apparent small-core advantage is only unbounded impractical sequential compute.
- `K3 INFINITE_PRECISION_ARTIFACT`: key separation depends on unphysical precision/weight encoding.
- `K4 VERIFIER_ORACLE_LAUNDERING`: verifier/access model supplies the hard part of the task.
- `K5 SEMANTIC_COMPILER_ORACLE`: language compiler contains uncosted intelligence.
- `K6 FORMAL_TO_REAL_GAP`: separation survives toy formal languages but no defensible bridge to useful task classes exists.
- `K7 RECURRENCE_INSTABILITY`: additional compute systematically degrades or cannot be routed safely.
- `K8 LEARNABILITY_FAILURE`: efficient solution exists algorithmically but cannot be learned under plausible information/sample constraints.
- `K9 NO_CORE_SAVING`: after honest whole-system accounting, immutable core does not shrink on any broad useful class.
- `K10 QUANTUM_NO_RESIDUAL`: state-prep/oracle/FT costs erase the candidate quantum advantage in the intended regime.
- `K11 ORION_CONTROL_NO_RESIDUAL`: verification/evidence/authority layer adds auditability but no task-efficiency/scientific residual; retain it as assurance, not architecture superiority.
- `K12 NOVELTY_COLLAPSE`: strongest parents already contain all substantive mechanics.

Valid terminals include `PARENT_SUFFICIENT`, `RESOURCE_TRADEOFF_ONLY`, `FORMAL_SEPARATION_ONLY`, `VERIFICATION_ONLY_VALUE`, `QUANTUM_OPERATOR_ONLY_VALUE`, `REGIME_LIMITED_POST_TRANSFORMER_RESIDUAL`, `NO_INCREMENTAL_VALUE`, or `CANNOT_CHECK`.

